    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/f57312417bc94ded343166787c21bad6.avif?t=1753897492\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face relentless demonic hordes in frantic combat, master over 50 unique weapons \u2014 including flamethrowers, grenades, elemental guns, and rotary machine guns \u2014 and unleash destruction on an epic scale. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With unlimited upgrades, a deep damage system, unique characters, and the ability to create insane custom builds, each run offers unique paths, explosive synergies, and near-infinite possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/e5dd1e9425a4cb0a74c2c4db2850b48a.avif?t=1753897492\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through brutal levels, confront colossal bosses, and uncover the secrets that bind Heaven and Hell \u2014 a world where Hell is leaderless, Lucifer has vanished, and a mysterious angel emerges from the shadows offering help. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this blood-soaked struggle, only the strongest will survive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/1cad5497484c3046f992926bc70799a5.avif?t=1753897492\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modify your weapons and abilities using Runes that grant devastating effects like multishot, orbital blades, elemental bursts, and more. Mix and match Runes to expand your arsenal and wreak havoc across the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/50c7768c37b8516a74b0f715c05560cb.poster.avif?t=1753897492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/50c7768c37b8516a74b0f715c05560cb.webm?t=1753897492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/50c7768c37b8516a74b0f715c05560cb.mp4?t=1753897492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from five distinct Paths \u2014 Time, Luck, Focus, Power, and Balance \u2014 and stack upgrades within the same path to unlock powerful synergies and become an unstoppable force of nature.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/5cd2cd0fab7f3456b9516a2162de6611.avif?t=1753897492\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully customize your build with over 76 unique passive abilities. Create absurd combinations and define your own playstyle \u2014 from a methodical exorcist to a chaotic destroyer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/1dfa7fcb9204934f5a2aa956f840faeb.poster.avif?t=1753897492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/1dfa7fcb9204934f5a2aa956f840faeb.webm?t=1753897492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/1dfa7fcb9204934f5a2aa956f840faeb.mp4?t=1753897492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/e61cc8578986755d522dfcfdd29863ee.avif?t=1753897492\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take down the Lords of Hell, fallen angels, and the guardians of Heaven in brutal encounters that will push your power to its absolute limits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/3bd2f700117639ea0e8cc44ac6ace276.poster.avif?t=1753897492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/3bd2f700117639ea0e8cc44ac6ace276.webm?t=1753897492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/3bd2f700117639ea0e8cc44ac6ace276.mp4?t=1753897492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/6965e4f597164e3f50c71b4eeb289427.avif?t=1753897492\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness the power of the elements in chaotic battles where each one plays a vital role. The system follows a rock-paper-scissors logic \u2014 Water extinguishes Fire, Fire explodes Gas, and Electricity becomes deadly in moist environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/143bd32ed06163627937a117dec8cef3.poster.avif?t=1753897492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/143bd32ed06163627937a117dec8cef3.webm?t=1753897492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/143bd32ed06163627937a117dec8cef3.mp4?t=1753897492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Devastating Effects</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elemental attacks inflict brutal conditions like freezing, burning, bleeding, and shocking, drastically altering the pace of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/a46894a111f5a92bbcb82e29561516f5.poster.avif?t=1753897492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/a46894a111f5a92bbcb82e29561516f5.webm?t=1753897492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/a46894a111f5a92bbcb82e29561516f5.mp4?t=1753897492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Elemental Interactions &amp; Adaptive Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elements react with one another in powerful and unexpected ways \u2014 fire ignites, water douses, electricity surges through moisture, and more. These interactions can drastically alter the flow of battle. Meanwhile, enemies adapt to their current state, gaining new resistances and vulnerabilities on the fly. To dominate the battlefield, you'll need to read the situation, combine elements wisely, and strike where it hurts most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/6b873ab56306a4f6b52934a118c5c6e5.avif?t=1753897492\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/f57312417bc94ded343166787c21bad6.avif?t=1753897492\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face relentless demonic hordes in frantic combat, master over 50 unique weapons \u2014 including flamethrowers, grenades, elemental guns, and rotary machine guns \u2014 and unleash destruction on an epic scale. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With unlimited upgrades, a deep damage system, unique characters, and the ability to create insane custom builds, each run offers unique paths, explosive synergies, and near-infinite possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/e5dd1e9425a4cb0a74c2c4db2850b48a.avif?t=1753897492\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight through brutal levels, confront colossal bosses, and uncover the secrets that bind Heaven and Hell \u2014 a world where Hell is leaderless, Lucifer has vanished, and a mysterious angel emerges from the shadows offering help. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this blood-soaked struggle, only the strongest will survive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/1cad5497484c3046f992926bc70799a5.avif?t=1753897492\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modify your weapons and abilities using Runes that grant devastating effects like multishot, orbital blades, elemental bursts, and more. Mix and match Runes to expand your arsenal and wreak havoc across the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/50c7768c37b8516a74b0f715c05560cb.poster.avif?t=1753897492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/50c7768c37b8516a74b0f715c05560cb.webm?t=1753897492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/50c7768c37b8516a74b0f715c05560cb.mp4?t=1753897492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from five distinct Paths \u2014 Time, Luck, Focus, Power, and Balance \u2014 and stack upgrades within the same path to unlock powerful synergies and become an unstoppable force of nature.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/5cd2cd0fab7f3456b9516a2162de6611.avif?t=1753897492\" data-has-big /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully customize your build with over 76 unique passive abilities. Create absurd combinations and define your own playstyle \u2014 from a methodical exorcist to a chaotic destroyer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/1dfa7fcb9204934f5a2aa956f840faeb.poster.avif?t=1753897492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/1dfa7fcb9204934f5a2aa956f840faeb.webm?t=1753897492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/1dfa7fcb9204934f5a2aa956f840faeb.mp4?t=1753897492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/e61cc8578986