o/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Devastating Effects</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elemental attacks inflict brutal conditions like freezing, burning, bleeding, and shocking, drastically altering the pace of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/a46894a111f5a92bbcb82e29561516f5.poster.avif?t=1753897492\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/a46894a111f5a92bbcb82e29561516f5.webm?t=1753897492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/a46894a111f5a92bbcb82e29561516f5.mp4?t=1753897492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Elemental Interactions &amp; Adaptive Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elements react with one another in powerful and unexpected ways \u2014 fire ignites, water douses, electricity surges through moisture, and more. These interactions can drastically alter the flow of battle. Meanwhile, enemies adapt to their current state, gaining new resistances and vulnerabilities on the fly. To dominate the battlefield, you'll need to read the situation, combine elements wisely, and strike where it hurts most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147530/extras/6b873ab56306a4f6b52934a118c5c6e5.avif?t=1753897492\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>",
